==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Minimal Shy Boy defense is able to deal with this stage rather easily.

